  "pinned_at": null,
  "word_count": 298,
  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u0346643c\" id=\"u0346643c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub22880ff\" id=\"ub22880ff\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">编译驱动有俩种方法，分别是将驱动</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uec53c4dd\" id=\"uec53c4dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">编译进内核</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc9cc9881\" id=\"uc9cc9881\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">和将驱动</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u095e2ad5\" id=\"u095e2ad5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">编译成内核模块</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4160472b\" id=\"u4160472b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"rLQZG\" id=\"rLQZG\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a611ac3\" id=\"u9a611ac3\" style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0)\">编译成内核模块文件</span></h1><h2 data-lake-id=\"H8BAZ\" id=\"H8BAZ\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f3cca4a\" id=\"u7f3cca4a\">编写Makefile</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22KERNEL_DIR%3D%2Fhome%2Fitcast%2Fproj%2Ftspi_buildroot%2Fkernel%5Cn%5CnARCH%3Darm64%5CnCROSS_COMPILE%3Daarch64-none-linux-gnu-%5Cnexport%20%20ARCH%20%20CROSS_COMPILE%5Cn%5Cnobj-m%20%3A%3D%20hellomodule.o%5Cnall%3A%5Cn%5Ct%24(MAKE)%20-C%20%24(KERNEL_DIR)%20M%3D%24(CURDIR)%20modules%5Cn%5Cn.PHONE%3Aclean%5Cn%5Cnclean%3A%5Cn%5Ct%24(MAKE)%20-C%20%24(KERNEL_DIR)%20M%3D%24(CURDIR)%20clean%5Ct%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Rolpn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u0910cec7\"><li fid=\"ua79ae1f7\" data-lake-id=\"u4ea4d345\" id=\"u4ea4d345\" style=\"text-align: left\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud4c01742\" id=\"ud4c01742\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34549f1a\" id=\"u34549f1a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">obj-m</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue412be48\" id=\"ue412be48\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 表示“编译成模块（module）”。</span></li><li fid=\"ua79ae1f7\" data-lake-id=\"u8373e484\" id=\"u8373e484\" style=\"text-align: left\"><code data-lake-id=\"u36d92bc1\" id=\"u36d92bc1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue79ee092\" id=\"ue79ee092\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">obj-y</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud314c9d6\" id=\"ud314c9d6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 表示“编译进内核镜像（built-in）”。</span></li><li fid=\"ua79ae1f7\" data-lake-id=\"u3e9bc057\" id=\"u3e9bc057\" style=\"text-align: left\"><code data-lake-id=\"u5efd506d\" id=\"u5efd506d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u372e24f0\" id=\"u372e24f0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">hellomodule.o</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub149a23e\" id=\"ub149a23e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 表示源文件是 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua512accc\" id=\"ua512accc\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc6cd3cb0\" id=\"uc6cd3cb0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">hellomodule.c</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaaf44129\" id=\"uaaf44129\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">（Kbuild 自动推导）。</span></li><li fid=\"ua79ae1f7\" data-lake-id=\"uf0c7a0a1\" id=\"uf0c7a0a1\" style=\"text-align: left\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19355e04\" id=\"u19355e04\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">如果模块由多个源文件组成，可以写成：</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22makefile%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22obj-m%20%3A%3D%20hellomodule.o%5Cnhellomodule-objs%20%3A%3D%20file1.o%20file2.o%20file3.o%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22__widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BRc1b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%7D\" hindent=\"2em\"></card><ul list=\"u67a2a4f1\"><li fid=\"ud401ec0d\" data-lake-id=\"ucdf892d7\" id=\"ucdf892d7\" style=\"text-align: left\"><code data-lake-id=\"u1578e568\" id=\"u1578e568\"><span data-lake-id=\"udd0fd2e1\" id=\"udd0fd2e1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">-C $(KERNEL_DIR)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u73e3915f\" id=\"u73e3915f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> → 切换到内核源码目录再执行 make。</span></li><li fid=\"ud401ec0d\" data-lake-id=\"u7b30928c\" id=\"u7b30928c\" style=\"text-align: left\"><code data-lake-id=\"u28189b1f\" id=\"u28189b1f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5fe9ff36\" id=\"u5fe9ff36\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">M=$(CURDIR)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0d5e57c5\" id=\"u0d5e57c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> → </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0d244160\" id=\"u0d244160\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">关键！</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0866c915\" id=\"u0866c915\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 告诉内核 Makefile：“模块源码在当前目录（即你的驱动目录）”。</span></li><li fid=\"ud401ec0d\" data-lake-id=\"uf5f6e68f\" id=\"uf5f6e68f\" style=\"text-align: left\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud618a20b\" id=\"ud618a20b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u904469a5\" id=\"u904469a5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">modules</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2044556f\" id=\"u2044556f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> → 要求内核 Makefile 只编译模块（而不是整个内核）。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"rqCQv\" id=\"rqCQv\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4db9902f\" id=\"u4db9902f\">编译准备</span></h2><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u1b729770\" id=\"u1b729770\"><p data-lake-id=\"ue0d682db\" id=\"ue0d682db\"><span data-lake-id=\"u262b2630\" id=\"u262b2630\">编译需要使用gcc-arm-10.3-2021.07-x86_64-aarch64-none-linux-gnu.tar编译器</span></p></blockquote><ol list=\"u9a8bb1b3\"><li fid=\"uac41a643\" data-lake-id=\"u34898b94\" id=\"u34898b94\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue125d47b\" id=\"ue125d47b\">需要把gcc-arm-10.3-2021.07-x86_64-aarch64-none-linux-gnu.tar解压到</span><code data-lake-id=\"u6966ae51\" id=\"u6966ae51\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ed8baa3\" id=\"u7ed8baa3\">/usr/local</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u04ab6d51\" id=\"u04ab6d51\">下</span></li><li fid=\"uac41a643\" data-lake-id=\"u92877941\" id=\"u92877941\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43c42fed\" id=\"u43c42fed\">编译</span><code data-lake-id=\"u934d132d\" id=\"u934d132d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u132947ec\" id=\"u132947ec\">/etc/profile</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufafc519c\" id=\"ufafc519c\">文件,最后一行加上</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22export%20PATH%3D%24PATH%3A%2Fusr%2Flocal%2Fgcc-arm-10.3-2021.07-x86_64-aarch64-none-linux-gnu%2Fbin%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UL6Hz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"XpOxl\" id=\"XpOxl\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2c08e7e3\" id=\"u2c08e7e3\">编译</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22make%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yx3my%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u46d0ff18\" id=\"u46d0ff18\"><p data-lake-id=\"uea949902\" id=\"uea949902\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubcd19eda\" id=\"ubcd19eda\">得到.ko文件就是驱动</span></p></blockquote><h1 data-lake-id=\"v3bWx\" id=\"v3bWx\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u750dc487\" id=\"u750dc487\">安装和卸载内核模块</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%5Cninsmod%20hellomodule.ko%5Cn%E5%8D%B8%E8%BD%BD%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%5Cnrmmod%20hellomodule.ko%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22juUD1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"MyMbz\" id=\"MyMbz\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e0a6cc1\" id=\"u2e0a6cc1\">查看模块信息</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lsmod%5Cnmodinfo%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VY514%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>",
